<title>THAILAND: Krung Thai Bank to set up insurance firm.</title>
<headline>Krung Thai Bank to set up insurance firm.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-backed commercial bank Krung Thai Bank said on Thursday it planned to set up a subsidiary to hold and manage an insurance company.</p>
<p>In a statement to the Stock Exchange of Thailand the bank said its board planned to form a holding company, called Krung Thai Holding Co Ltd, to manage a new insurance firm.</p>
</text>
